# ─── Kite AI Testnet (x402 payments) ──────────────────────
KITE_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.gokite.ai
# Kite wallets are auto-generated by setup-kite-wallets.ts
# and stored in kite-wallets.json (not in .env)

